{
  "file": "module2",
  "page": 26,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.30284118652344,
        301.64349365234375,
        84.57283782958984
      ],
      "text": "2.1.2 Implementation considerations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 14.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        91.27869415283203,
        527.4080200195312,
        105.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "The magnitude and balance of desirable and undesirable effects vary according the epidemiological",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        104.47870635986328,
        527.4431762695312,
        118.92170715332031
      ],
      "text": "conditions (the prevalence of TB and of risk factors) and the intensity of the screening intervention",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        117.67871856689453,
        527.5784301757812,
        132.12171936035156
      ],
      "text": "being implemented (the coverage of the population and the sensitivity of the screening test and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        130.8787384033203,
        527.5038452148438,
        145.3217315673828
      ],
      "text": "algorithm). There is currently no evidence that population-wide screening using less sensitive screening",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95219612121582,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        144.07875061035156,
        527.4267578125,
        158.52174377441406
      ],
      "text": "algorithms that begin with symptom screening are effective at reducing the population prevalence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.27870178222656,
        527.1571655273438,
        171.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "or transmission of TB. However, there is limited evidence that screening utilizing symptom-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        170.4788360595703,
        527.3712158203125,
        184.9218292236328
      ],
      "text": "screening tools may benefit individuals who are diagnosed with TB by leading to earlier diagnosis with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973718643188477,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.67884826660156,
        527.42333984375,
        198.12184143066406
      ],
      "text": "less severe TB disease, lower costs to the patient and lower risk of catastrophic costs associated with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        196.87879943847656,
        527.4454956054688,
        211.32179260253906
      ],
      "text": "the course of disease. The balance of potential benefits and harms of screening may tip in favour of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        210.07875061035156,
        527.62158203125,
        224.52174377441406
      ],
      "text": "the intervention depending on factors such as the prevalence of TB in the population to be screened",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.997949600219727,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        223.27870178222656,
        527.3892822265625,
        237.72169494628906
      ],
      "text": "(particularly undetected TB), the accuracy of the screening and diagnostic tests used, the degree of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        236.4788360595703,
        444.28643798828125,
        250.9218292236328
      ],
      "text": "current TB case detection and the vulnerability of the population being screened.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        258.18267822265625,
        527.4069213867188,
        272.6257019042969
      ],
      "text": "Screening should be conducted using the most sensitive and specific screening algorithm possible,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        271.3826904296875,
        527.1157836914062,
        285.8257141113281
      ],
      "text": "with a screening test that identifies those with a higher likelihood of having TB and a diagnostic test to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981935501098633,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.58270263671875,
        527.606689453125,
        299.0257263183594
      ],
      "text": "confirm the diagnosis. Highly accurate screening tests such as CXR and mWRDs have high sensitivity,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.998099327087402,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        297.78271484375,
        527.399169921875,
        312.2257385253906
      ],
      "text": "specificity, or both; however, the feasibility of their use is affected by resource and implementation",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        310.98272705078125,
        527.349365234375,
        325.4257507324219
      ],
      "text": "requirements. Symptom screening is less accurate (reduced sensitivity, specificity, or both), but is",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        324.1827087402344,
        527.5321044921875,
        338.625732421875
      ],
      "text": "generally considered much more feasible to implement. Recent evidence suggests that reductions in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999350547790527,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        337.3827209472656,
        527.3903198242188,
        351.82574462890625
      ],
      "text": "the population prevalence of TB can be achieved with repeated annual screenings using a sensitive",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        339.0906066894531,
        347.7886962890625,
        355.40472412109375,
        364.970703125
      ],
      "text": "(13)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.981884956359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        379.2702941894531,
        350.47271728515625,
        424.383056640625,
        364.82769775390625
      ],
      "text": "Section 3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.981884956359863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        350.58270263671875,
        527.3682250976562,
        365.0257263183594
      ],
      "text": "screening algorithm (mWRD followed by clinical evaluation) . See   for recommendations",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.981884956359863,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.78271484375,
        325.1114807128906,
        378.2257385253906
      ],
      "text": "on tools for screening for more discussion on this topic.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        385.4866027832031,
        527.1038818359375,
        399.92962646484375
      ],
      "text": "While the implementation of a population-wide screening programme inevitably requires a significant",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.97562313079834,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        398.6866149902344,
        527.4542846679688,
        413.129638671875
      ],
      "text": "investment of resources, overall there may be potential long-term savings to be made for health",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        411.8865966796875,
        527.4177856445312,
        426.3296203613281
      ],
      "text": "services through reduced future incidence. The costs of conducting community-wide screening will",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        425.08660888671875,
        527.6068115234375,
        439.5296325683594
      ],
      "text": "vary greatly, depending on the screening and diagnostic tests used and the population prevalence of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990845680236816,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        438.28662109375,
        527.4638061523438,
        452.7296447753906
      ],
      "text": "TB. The cost–effectiveness of population-wide screening using a highly accurate algorithm is unknown,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.95937442779541,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.4866027832031,
        527.2055053710938,
        465.92962646484375
      ],
      "text": "but the higher the prevalence, the more cost–effective the intervention will be. Using a highly accurate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.968254089355469,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        464.6866149902344,
        527.5953979492188,
        479.129638671875
      ],
      "text": "screening and diagnostic algorithm will inevitably require more resources than using symptom-based",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.984739303588867,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        477.8865966796875,
        492.12005615234375,
        492.3296203613281
      ],
      "text": "screening approaches, but it has a greater potential to reduce the population burden of TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        499.5906066894531,
        527.5881958007812,
        514.0336303710938
      ],
      "text": "The optimal frequency of screening in a general population to achieve individual- or community-level",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.978428840637207,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        512.7906494140625,
        527.5379638671875,
        527.233642578125
      ],
      "text": "benefits remains unclear. There is also uncertainty about how people value the benefits expected from",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.970510482788086,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        525.9906005859375,
        527.4223022460938,
        540.43359375
      ],
      "text": "being screened. A review of qualitative studies of community perceptions of TB screening showed",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        539.1906127929688,
        527.3912963867188,
        553.6336059570312
      ],
      "text": "that, in general, screening was acceptable. However, resistance to screening was common, resulting",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        552.390625,
        527.6347045898438,
        566.8336181640625
      ],
      "text": "from a combination of disparate factors, such as having a perception of being at low risk for TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        565.590576171875,
        527.4212646484375,
        580.0335693359375
      ],
      "text": "among healthy participants, having little conviction in the effectiveness of screening, holding in poor",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        578.7905883789062,
        527.4046020507812,
        593.2335815429688
      ],
      "text": "regard TB services offered in the community, having concerns about confidentiality and the possible",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.9906005859375,
        442.711181640625,
        606.43359375
      ],
      "text": "disclosure of diagnosis, and being anxious about the need to take TB medication.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.6945190429688,
        527.436767578125,
        628.1375122070312
      ],
      "text": "Separate recommendations are made for select high-risk groups in the following sections. See the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        626.89453125,
        527.580322265625,
        641.3375244140625
      ],
      "text": "operational handbook for more details on the practicalities of implementing TB screening interventions",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951493263244629,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        637.3004760742188,
        253.3802032470703,
        654.5374755859375
      ],
      "text": "(7) using different tools and algorithms  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        796.217041015625,
        136.43409729003906,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        796.217041015625,
        170.0604705810547,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        796.217041015625,
        226.65042114257812,
        806.7210083007812
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
